+# Async runtime
+
+No async runtime decision is currently recorded for this project. The only trace in the project's history is a one-line remark in an earlier session ("async-std runtime") that was never recorded as a decision and was never confirmed. It is therefore not treated as a standing policy, and no runtime is designated until one is explicitly decided and recorded.
